   "txt": "**1. Single Most Important Fact**\nComputer Age Management Services Limited (CAMS) announced that its Integrated Annual Report for FY 2025\u201326 received two recognitions at the 2026 Spotlight Awards (Global Communications Competition) organized by the League of American Communications Professionals LLC (LACP): a Gold Award and a Platinum Award.\n\n---\n\n**2. Key Numbers Exactly as Stated**\n*Financial performance metrics (Revenue, EBITDA, PAT, margins, etc.) are **not reported** in this filing.*\n\nAward evaluation scores and rankings stated:\n* **Platinum Award (Report: Annual Report category):** Total score of **99 out of 100**; Top 100 Rank: **31**.\n  * First Impression: 30/30 | Overall Narrative: 10/10 | Overall Visual Design: 10/10 | Creativity: 19/20 | Message Clarity: 20/20 | Perceived Relevance: 10/10.\n* **Gold Award (Report: Integrated Report category):** Total score of **98 out of 100**; Top 100 Rank: **31**.\n  * First Impression: 29/30 | Overall Narrative: 10/10 | Overall Visual Design: 10/10 | Creativity: 20/20 | Message Clarity: 20/20 | Perceived Relevance: 9/10.\n\n---\n\n**3. Management Guidance or Forward Outlook**\n* None provided in the filing.\n\n---\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On**\n* No immediate shareholder action is required; this is a routine non-financial disclosure regarding corporate reporting and communications recognition.\n\n---\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**\n* **Neutral**: The announcement highlights good corporate reporting and ESG/communication standards, but has no material impact on earnings or business fundamentals."
