  {
   "s": "LT",
   "n": "Larsen & Toubro Limited",
   "cat": "Bagging/Receiving of orders/contracts",
   "when": "2026-11-23 09:34",
   "sent": "positive",
   "txt": "**1. Single Most Important Fact**  \nL&T Group company Vyoma.AI, via its AI infrastructure subsidiary LTN Compute, has secured a multi-year \"Large\" order (valued between \u20b92,500 crore and \u20b95,000 crore) to deploy additional NVIDIA B300 GPUs at its Chennai Data Center as part of a 10,000 GPU cluster.\n\n---\n\n**2. Key Numbers Exactly as Stated**  \n* **Order Value:** Classified as **\"Large\\*\"**, which corresponds to **\u20b92,500 to 5,000 Crore** (per L&T's standard order classification table).  \n* **GPU Cluster:** Deployment of additional NVIDIA B300 GPUs as part of a **10,000 GPU cluster**.  \n* **Campus Scale / Power Readiness:** \n  * Envisioned as a **gigawatt-scale** AI infrastructure hub.\n  * **Phase 1:** Designed for **250 MW**, supported by **150 MVA** power infrastructure readiness.  \n*(Note: Financial performance metrics such as revenue, EBITDA, margins, or PAT are not included in this order-win release).*\n\n---\n\n**3. Management Guidance & Forward Statements**  \n* **Chairman & Managing Director, S N Subrahmanyan:** Stated that AI Factories will provide foundational infrastructure to power industry transformation, and this deployment *\"marks another significant milestone in L&T\u2019s vision to build world-class AI infrastructure in India\"* to deliver scale, performance, and resilience for global AI innovation.  \n* **Operational Scope:** LTN Compute plans to build next-generation AI-ready digital infrastructure across India via hyperscale AI data centers, sovereign cloud platforms, AI Factory services, Bare Metal-as-a-Service (BMaaS), and GPU-as-a-Service (GPUaaS).\n\n---\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On**  \n* Track the execution and ramp-up of the Chennai AI Factory Phase 1 (250 MW / 150 MVA readiness).  \n* Watch for subsequent contract wins and recurring revenue realization from high-margin compute offerings (GPUaaS/BMaaS) within Vyoma.AI / LTN Compute.\n\n---\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**  \n**Positive:** Expands L&T's footprint into high-margin AI digital infrastructure with a confirmed \u20b92,500\u20135,000 Cr order win, reinforcing growth outside core traditional EPC."
  }
